      "dcterms:description": "capabilities.jsonldに基づくE2E BDD（Cucumber + Playwright）およびE2E TDD（Playwright）テストフレームワークの統合実装。Red-Green-Refactorサイクルに従ったテスト駆動開発をE2Eレベルで実現。",
      "status": "completed",
      "dependencies": [
        "node:testing",
        "node:e2e-tdd-implementation"
      ],
      "implementation": [
        "performers/etzhayyim-performer-org-etzhayyim-sys-app-hrse-pba7d22f/features/support/e2e-world.ts",
        "performers/etzhayyim-performer-org-etzhayyim-sys-app-hrse-pba7d22f/features/support/e2e-hooks.ts",
